    <data key="d0">IoT Monitoring and Visualization Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Whiteboard diagram illustrating an end-to-end IoT data ingestion, processing, storage, and visualization solution using AWS serverless services.</data>
    <data key="d3">IoT, Analytics, Serverless</data>
